description: Short answers to "how do I…" in nine turtles, one page each.
permalink: /help/
---
{#- The Help index (decision 0157): a book's table of contents, one plain
    list per group, in the order _data/helpGroups.json gives. Each page's
    place in its group is its front matter's "order". -#}
<p class="lede">
  Short answers to "how do I…", one page each. If what you need isn't here,
  <a href="/contact/">write to me</a> and I'll add it.
</p>
<p>New to feeds? <a href="/new-to-feeds/">Start with this three-minute page</a>.</p>
{%- for group in helpGroups %}
<section class="help-group" aria-labelledby="{{ group.id }}">
  <h2 id="{{ group.id }}">{{ group.title }}</h2>
  <ul class="help-list">
    {%- for item in collections.help | where("data.groupId", group.id) | sort(false, false, "data.order") %}
    <li><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
{%- endfor %}
